  "title": "Telephone / Radio Reference/ Contact Numbers",
  "markdown": "# Telephone / Radio Reference/ Contact Numbers\n\n### Region 4:\n* Contact Maine EMS\n* Regional Medical Director: Beth Collamore, M.D.\n* 207-626-3866\n* maine.ems@maine.gov\n\n### Maine ACEP Representative\nKelly Klein, M.D.\n\n### At-Large Representative\nPeter Tilney, D.O.\n\n### Clinical Pharmacist/Pharmacology Representative\nBethany Nash, PharmD, AEMT\n\n### ALS Representative\nColin Ayer, EMT-P\n\n### BLS Representative\nEmily Bryant, PharmD, AEMT\n\n### Pediatric Representative/EMS-C Medical Director\nRachel Williams, M.D.\n\n### Bioterrorism /WMD\nIf you suspect a chemical or biological agent threat, call your local law enforcement agency immediately.\n\n### Maine Bureau of Health Emergency\n| | |\n|---|---|\n| Reporting and Consultation | 1-800-821-5821 |\n| Maine National Guard 11th Civil Support Team (WMD) | 207-877-9623 |\n| Maine Emergency Management Agency | 207-624-4400 |\n\n### To Report Workplace Injury:\n**Bureau of Labor**\n| | |\n|---|---|\n| Business Hours | 207-623-7923 |\n| Evenings & Weekends | 207-592-4501 |\n",
